            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-append",
        "moduleId": "trace-the-example",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "用 append 向列表末尾添加项目",
        "markdown": "`append` 方法把新对象追加到列表末尾。教材的示例先调用 `shoplist.append('rice')`，随后把整个列表交给 `print`，用完整输出来确认项目确实被加了进去。\n\n这种“修改后立刻打印检查”的习惯，在调试列表操作时非常实用。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000099"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据结构",
                "它是如何工作的"
              ],
              "lineStart": 838,
              "lineEnd": 850,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0e014baab71e1b33da958b1bf21f36efdaaf33ecba24aaed228dc9d7b00386be"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-append-trace",
        "moduleId": "trace-the-example",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "补充追踪：一次 append 前后发生了什么",
        "markdown": "设列表当前为 `['apple', 'mango', 'carrot', 'banana']`：\n\n```python\nshoplist.append('rice')\nprint(shoplist)\n```\n\n执行后原列表变成五项，最后一项是 `'rice'`。`append` 的返回值是 `None`，它通过修改原列表来产生效果，而不是返回一个新列表；要观察结果，应该打印 `shoplist` 本身。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-append"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-sort",
        "moduleId": "in-place-mutation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "sort 修改列表本身",
        "markdown": "`shoplist.sort()` 对列表进行排序。教材特别强调：这个方法影响的是列表本身，而不会返回一个修改过的列表。这与字符串的处理方式不同——字符串是不可变的（Immutable），任何看似修改字符串的操作都会产生新字符串。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000099"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据结构",
                "它是如何工作的"
              ],
              "lineStart": 838,
              "lineEnd": 850,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0e014baab71e1b33da958b1bf21f36efdaaf33ecba24aaed228dc9d7b00386be"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-sort-misconception",
        "moduleId": "in-place-mutation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "常见误区：sort() 会返回新列表",
        "markdown": "下面的写法会得到 `None`，而不是排序后的列表：\n\n```python\nresult = shoplist.sort()\nprint(result)   # None\n```\n\n因为 `sort()` 是原地（in-place）排序，排序结果保存在 `shoplist` 中。如果确实需要一份排好序的副本而不改动原列表，可以先用 `sorted(shoplist)` 生成新列表，再对副本操作。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-sort"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-del",
        "moduleId": "in-place-mutation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "用 del 按位置删除项目",
        "markdown": "要从列表中移除某个项目，示例使用 `del` 语句并给出位置：`del shoplist[0]`。Python 从 0 开始计数，所以 `[0]` 指的是第一个项目。\n\n`del` 直接按位置删除，不需要知道该位置上的值。教材还提示可以用 `help(list)` 查看列表对象定义的全部方法。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000099"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据结构",
                "它是如何工作的"
              ],
              "lineStart": 838,
